# V2 go-vikunja/vikunja frontend, commit a16be96aa454671fdf213b0fbe411dd38a098418
# Hand-derived from src/router/index.ts:46-489 (routes passed to createRouter at :27).
# Rule: every route record with a path is one URL, including redirect-only records (/user/settings :98-101, /lists :238-247, /projects/:projectId :365-382).
# Absolute child paths stay absolute (/user/settings children :104-200, incl. /migrate/csv :191 and /migrate/:service :196); relative children join (/admin :456-488).
# A parent and its '' child share one URL (/admin :456,464). Regex params keep their name (:projectId(\\d+) -> :projectId), so the two
# settings/edit and settings/delete records (:271/:338, :312/:347) collapse to one URL each.
# /:pathMatch(.*)* (:53) and /:pathMatch(.*) (:59) both match every path: one catch-all "*". /lists:pathMatch(.*)* (:238) is written /lists/*.
